1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,090
(Raj:)Don't try to change me, dude.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,070
(Raj:)I am what I am.

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:07,390
(Sheldon:)Oh, gentlemen.

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:09,440
(Howard:)Hey. Aren't you going
to introduce us

5
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,110
(Howard:)to your little friend?

6
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,580
(Sheldon:)My apologies.

7
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:17,350
(Sheldon:)Raj, Howard, I'd like you to meet Dr.
Robert Oppenheimer.

8
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,620
Hello. Hi.

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,910
(Sheldon:)Now, if you'll excuse me,

10
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:25,430
(Sheldon:)the father of the atomic
bomb wants a saucer of milk.

11
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,550
(Howard:)Okay, I get it.
We're worried about Sheldon.

12
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,010
(Leonard:)Yeah.

13
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,850
(Penny:)Hey.

14
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:38,370
(Leonard:)Oh, no.

15
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,970
(Sheldon:)Robert Oppenheimer was lonely.

16
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:44,200
(Leonard:)So you decided to get the
whole Manhattan Project?

17
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:50,210
(Sheldon:)Yes. This is Enrico Fermi, Richard Feynman,
Edward Teller,  Otto Frisch...

18
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,920
(Sheldon:)...Zazzles.
- Zazzles?

19
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,170
I was going to name him Hermann Von Helmholtz

20
00:00:56,170 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)but he's so zazzy.

